---
/**
 * Try path — hosted Chirp explorer (browse-only) + local setup.
 */
---

<section class="splash-demo" aria-labelledby="splash-demo-title">
	<p class="splash-demo__warn" role="note">
		<strong>Demo only.</strong> The hosted explorer is browse-only — no live Send or MCP.
	</p>

	<header class="splash-demo__intro">
		<h2 id="splash-demo-title" class="splash-demo__title">Try it</h2>
		<p class="splash-demo__lede">
			Chirp is a fictional Twitter-shaped API built with Callspec. The hosted explorer lets you
			read routes, schemas, and MCP connect snippets. To actually send requests or wire MCP into
			Cursor or Claude, clone the repo, install dependencies, and run the local demo server.
		</p>
		<div class="splash-demo__actions">
			<a class="splash-demo__btn splash-demo__btn--primary" href="/demo/">
				Browse the explorer
				<span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
			</a>
			<a class="splash-demo__btn splash-demo__btn--secondary" href="/development/">
				Development setup
				<span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
			</a>
		</div>
	</header>

	<figure class="splash-demo__shot">
		<a href="/demo/" class="splash-demo__shot-link">
			<img
				src="/chirp-demo.png"
				alt="Chirp docs UI — routes sidebar, Connect MCP panel, Cursor MCP config"
				width="1600"
				height="1000"
				loading="lazy"
			/>
		</a>
	</figure>

	<aside class="splash-demo__local" aria-label="Run Chirp locally">
		<p class="splash-demo__local-label">
			Want live try-it + MCP? Clone, install, then run the local server —
			<a href="/development/">full steps in Development</a>.
		</p>
		<div class="splash-demo__terminal" aria-label="Terminal">
			<span class="splash-demo__chrome" aria-hidden="true">
				<span></span><span></span><span></span>
			</span>
			<div class="splash-demo__cli-line">
				<span class="splash-demo__prompt" aria-hidden="true">$</span>
				<code>
					<span class="splash-demo__tok-muted">git clone</span>
					{' '}
					<span class="splash-demo__tok-cmd">https://github.com/logfoxai/callspec.git</span>
				</code>
			</div>
			<div class="splash-demo__cli-line">
				<span class="splash-demo__prompt" aria-hidden="true">$</span>
				<code>
					<span class="splash-demo__tok-cmd">cd callspec && npm install</span>
				</code>
			</div>
			<div class="splash-demo__cli-line">
				<span class="splash-demo__prompt" aria-hidden="true">$</span>
				<code>
					<span class="splash-demo__tok-muted">npm run</span>
					{' '}
					<span class="splash-demo__tok-cmd">serve:chirp-demo</span>
				</code>
			</div>
			<div class="splash-demo__cli-meta">
				<span class="splash-demo__pill">Then open <code>http://127.0.0.1:3456/v1/docs</code></span>
				<span class="splash-demo__pill">Bearer <code>demo</code></span>
			</div>
		</div>
	</aside>
</section>
